{"id":"3341b97427794006","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bptime.md","title":"有界错误概率时间类","display":"df-bptime — 有界错误概率时间类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bptime","aliases":["28-df-bptime"],"display":"df-bptime — 有界错误概率时间类","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-characteristic-language]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 7.2","source_printed_pages":"125","source_pdf_pages":"151","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bptime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bptime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bptime — 有界错误概率时间类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 7.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(n)\\ge n+1\">\\(T(n)\\ge n+1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTM},T_N,O_N,\\nu\">\\(\\mathsf{RTM},T_N,O_N,\\nu\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a> 的两个转移表与无限公平随机带语义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L\">\\(\\chi_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BPTIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(T_N(x,r)\\le cT(|x|)\\land O_N(x,r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\right)\\land\\nu\\{r:O_N(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)\\}\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BPTIME}(T)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(T_N(x,r)\\le cT(|x|)\\land O_N(x,r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\right)\\land\\nu\\{r:O_N(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)\\}\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>时间上界对每一随机带成立；错误界对每一个输入成立。由于至多读取cT(n)位硬币，相关事件只依赖有限前缀，可测性自动成立。不能把期望时间界代入此定义而不另外论证。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 7.2；印刷 pp.125 / PDF pp.151。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"i